compliant and unambiguous_, sure. They may (or may not) be important for ot=
her purposes. One among these is making the language practical to learn and=
 use. This may be an "extrinsic goal" by your terminology, but =E2=80=A6 if=
 someone is ever going to finish the work of fully specifying the cmavo, we=
